# Copy to `.env` at the repo root. Never commit a real `.env`.
#
# Account checklist (eBay, Apple, Google, Expo): see README.md → "Required accounts (self-build)".
#
# eBay Browse API (client credentials) — called from the app via `lib/ebayBrowseClient.ts`.
# Expo inlines `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` into the client JS bundle (anyone can inspect a shipped app). For strong
# secret protection, proxy eBay through your own server instead of shipping credentials in the client.
EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_CLIENT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Default keyword search for the “All” lane (Browse `q`).
EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_DEFAULT_Q=deals

# Optional — defaults shown
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_API_ROOT=https://api.ebay.com
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_MARKETPLACE_ID=EBAY_US
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EBAY_OAUTH_SCOPE=https://api.ebay.com/oauth/api_scope

# EAS / CI — optional; use `eas login` locally instead.
# https://docs.expo.dev/accounts/programmatic-access/
# EXPO_TOKEN=
